      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING ZEAL (4) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (24.83) at Goulburn in a Grade 5 over 440m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Can go on with it. MARKET MAVERICK (1) scored two back then was always well back and could manage only a 3 length 7th at this track (19.73). Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Shapes as one to consider. SCATTER DUNN (8) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at The Gardens over 515m behind Impress Moana (30.37) in a Grade 4/5. Better than last start and can bounce back. AUSSIE BLEND (7) profiles nicely over this trip.",
